      "side": 1,
      "message": "This is only called on GATT disconnection, which seems quite concerning to me. There\u0027s no guarantee that the similar issue could only happen on the GATT devices.",
      "revId": "9e8f43f59cecf9e3cc1615c3cb1a8707717ba3d8",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "ba43f476_308306e5",
        "filename": "system/gd/rust/linux/stack/src/bluetooth.rs",
        "patchSetId": 2
